<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20251226T183821" id="bb93caa9-e934-4cda-aa07-9ccab99bcbbd">
    <XRef DateTime="20250719T224917" id="326d3bbb-277d-4966-b8b4-fc0c38660087"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20250719T225100" id="311bf653-30ed-4d65-a49b-1d9bc7012bab"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="67c8084b-dbe1-4043-9f21-275709f2a5ec">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Dirty City - Dawn</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7da9e7af-4fe3-43b2-b7c6-11301c202139">
      <Text>We see the welcome sign of Dirty City, Woodwork. Below, it reads: “The Cleanest City in the Garden Nation.” The city is filled with terracotta pots that house its resident plants.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="540a05c9-c339-4963-86ea-56a3f15793de">
      <Text>Parsley (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6aa9584-b61b-4534-a4f2-45bf4cdf8dde">
      <Text>It’s dirt cheap in Dirty City, Woodwork. Life is simple for us plants growing up here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e52db445-31e5-4d3d-a419-7338d927e4f5">
      <Text>A beetle bug-looking car drives into the city.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d4c26f16-0367-4d0b-bb9e-91501c8f4676">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Beetle Car - Moments LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af273816-5ad2-4532-81c6-e3bf5337b30a">
      <Text>We see through the windshield as the car stops at a redlight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d06c5d3e-b13d-4eb8-bc9f-fc1c4cd13fc5">
      <Text>Parsley (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91a288dd-3ff0-4dd0-9853-d90ea1f8ee76">
      <Text>You get sun, you some water...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="229e37e7-8f33-4543-a0c7-e3b8e5526e94">
      <Text>To the right of the stoplight is a salon, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="98503d54-012e-4d53-80e4-eaa7c223bdf0">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BOMBUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e06c34b5-16ff-473c-9631-ae99de97f833">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Parsley Ram</Text>
      <Text> (11) is sweeping the front. He has bushy green hair, wearing brown overalls, and has human limbs like all plants in this world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9eaf09b9-dc9c-4bed-af78-9c9172fcb071">
      <Text>ParslEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="94a2c678-5421-4ff4-8b9c-d8855fc72ea0">
      <Text>...so long as your mom doesn’t rip your leaves off-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f574c81-a147-4ec5-962c-a6420efe47eb">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Rau Ram</Text>
      <Text> (36) peeks out of the door. She is a cilantro. Her earthly hair gleams. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b9054db3-0d98-4d7d-ace7-21e2a16f4439">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00fa15ea-02b6-4358-a3cc-9b4dbed0799f">
      <Text>Parsley! You can talk to your imaginary friends once you finish sweeping </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. Pronto?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2ac6f583-19b2-4711-9a74-94e6dbcf9688">
      <Text>Rau goes back inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b0da0f04-4fea-4090-9e2a-5ec32415a5bf">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b75784c9-795f-49e0-8b03-f4dc5c722bb5">
      <Text>Love you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c632faaa-f290-4afc-8653-8226c365baba">
      <Text>A 13-year-old pear named </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Pyrus Crabapple</Text>
      <Text> pops out of the window in the neighboring nightclub called </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="34f24bab-7a4e-4045-b0ad-c8f6e7efaefe">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6116886c-c4c6-421e-9983-e3726562b0a4">
      <Text>Your mom didn’t say you can’t talk to your real friend?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9b8299a-362a-4f67-9e50-9271266eacb3">
      <Text>Pyrus climbs out of the window. They approach Parsley. They interrupt him just as he is about to speak.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7207bd1e-7e96-47cc-a7a6-219a84cdf598">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5f96b3c-5cf6-401a-81e8-28deafcf2a77">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ope</Text>
      <Text>! Save your narration for the sneezeworts. Germinations, imaginary friends! I’m Pyrus! Nibling of Malus Crabapple, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text> Nightclub’s owner. Neighbor of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. But mostly, this town knows Parsley and I are a great pair...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fdfc8ab-0ac2-4832-9e54-9f1da21637bb">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eac3f833-0f50-47e3-919f-1bc17f30e148">
      <Text>...of trouble. You dirty pear. You’ve been counting how many sweeps I got in?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b85c8535-0cc1-42ce-9fb1-930c3a78acbb">
      <Text>PyrUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="17aa6794-7d21-4fc3-9ee8-4ae77bfb55e1">
      <Text>Nah. I’ve been watching that beetle. It ain’t moving from that redlight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe78a7db-560a-4e7c-8f40-df58d74ed286">
      <Text>Parsley turns to see the beetle under the stoplight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac18b73e-ea48-44cb-b384-b39f1b463793">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5f18176-1245-4848-ab6d-40a01e1332d6">
      <Text>Let’s change that to yellow. Oh Bombus!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb1377fc-740b-46ab-88e5-34a95c5c53a7">
      <Text>Rather than the side door of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>, a giant pet bee named </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Bombus</Text>
      <Text>, breaks out of the side window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f19f45b-410a-4ade-b6e3-38ca942e6560">
      <Text>Bombus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc4cb887-de64-439c-a22c-cf9b0ecc48b7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Buzzzzzzzzzzzzz</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9dbf782d-03dd-46dd-a1de-9f6090474e9b">
      <Text>ParslEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9cddc7b-d450-464a-8ef5-4ef0a9fb9796">
      <Text>You still </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> door-train them...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ecd885d-355d-492c-9524-cb5faeecc3ec">
      <Text>Bombus flies and lands on the stoplight. They squeeze their body in the redlight and emit a yellow glow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4b56e69-72cb-47c1-a578-37258cc9ac70">
      <Text>The beetle car moves and stops in front of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Verbena</Text>
      <Text> (20s) steps out with her clipboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="702a4a25-558d-421e-b5c2-d2e95336450d">
      <Text>Rau swiftly steps outside. She wears grey trousers with the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> logo. She whispers to Parsley and Pyrus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa523dfa-2e28-4739-ba84-fc611c263226">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="6759c9b3-6fd4-4f7f-b4f2-b5c077971a45">
      <Text>(to Parsley)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bef86cce-e19e-4b47-b12e-cc2aa99d112f">
      <Text>Hide the Bee’s Knees ointments. It’s not WDA-approved yet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="630dedfd-0733-4321-896d-faf09c4f1428">
      <Text>(to Pyrus)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5fa038ed-5d3e-43d0-9de1-20d8647f474b">
      <Text>Don’t get us in trouble. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Again</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee4b051d-122d-493c-b060-7000d1f294fa">
      <Text>Parsley rushes inside </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. Pyrus follows and makes a loud crash inside. Rau closes an eye, trying to ignore it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27235f44-ba0d-4d82-a140-68b9f71d6b9c">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="360f5619-9992-431c-b074-79edbed38fc6">
      <Text>Welcome to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. The finest salon in all of Woodwork.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7ed78a9-cbcf-4eab-9c87-6301c61d4050">
      <Text>Verbena</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b21f301c-4dd9-4004-a28a-b9e075e7cdb8">
      <Text>Listen. This ain’t an inspection to shut you down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9a4c56c1-94ec-4f07-8677-2c522d660319">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c52b2993-385b-49b1-a577-4778c7558255">
      <Text>Oh thank the higher farmer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54cad692-7af5-446a-8282-7bd547517d96">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b70d77ea-c082-4b07-b70d-600ecdf262a1">
      <Text>Verbena. I’m a location scout for </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11a26b7b-c084-4e04-88ed-dfc6c8f0061c">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86ba58c3-1993-4ded-b123-6fbff77d3b35">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> Mentha of-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="162c2b75-3130-44a5-bea1-a31fd59f03cb">
      <Text>VerBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5bef237-0cc4-49d7-84bd-61e1c7e7197c">
      <Text>Mint Condition. Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="894c3366-bc6e-4d78-94e9-c59018c49a5c">
      <Text>Rau wipes out a bunch of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">DVD</Text>
      <Text> cases.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="202a854a-0d4f-480f-90d7-aab2571bf7ea">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7976b536-b78e-45db-8be1-ceb3bd74c042">
      <Text>I have every season on green-ray and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">DVD</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e78085d4-ed14-4556-abff-d2613993ad65">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b70d77ea-c082-4b07-b70d-600ecdf262a1">
      <Text>I wasn’t planning to make a stop here. But your bee helped get me out of a sticky situation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0311b72-e7c6-477f-bb76-f1263e06b33f">
      <Text>Rau sees Bombus is resting on the stoplight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6907b08f-a497-4920-8944-16a59396f4ff">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0abf3cd8-610f-4bb0-babc-a0d6a2b42267">
      <Text>Dirty City really needs to fix that light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5b046796-854b-427e-b755-a0a8b5b9fe9f">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad697e84-fc74-4437-a39a-b0f34777f345">
      <Text>May I take a look inside </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="dc05621c-68bf-4150-88ca-5daeabcc0765">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 3/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS &amp; PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU RAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALONTRO</Text>
      <Text> - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ac61a77-bbd1-407e-be9f-cc1715a7b2d5">
      <Text>The salon is a masterpiece of "Natural-Deco"—mirrors framed in weeping willow vines and chairs carved from giant oak-stumps. PARSLEY is frantically shoving a tray of neon-glowing “Bee’s Knees” jars into a secret floorboard as VERBENA enters, heels clicking on the terra-cotta tile.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5cd96943-b135-4ac4-a8ee-ffdd15c94939">
      <Text>PARSLEY (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f748ed7d-96f3-4edc-a5b9-86339d4809f0">
      <Text>(Whispering/Cynical)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ce8986f-98cd-4a4b-8808-e9988d3efd01">
      <Text>My name is Parsley. I’m eleven years old, and I’m currently committing a botanical felony to help my mom get the "Greenlight."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0cf307b2-a94a-405f-afe7-e4e5a0ee68cd">
      <Text>PYRUS is tangled in a hanging ivy-plant, having crashed through the ceiling. BOMBUS peeks through the window, vibrating with excitement.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33281082-eb16-4a05-92eb-b3dc45346569">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a4a980f3-72b0-4c31-8deb-1511bfe8ccda">
      <Text>(Looking around, unimpressed)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ca115b9-5e1c-4670-97ed-1ae0adc497f0">
      <Text>It’s... earthy. A bit "transplant-chic," isn't it? Lami Mentha usually prefers something with more prestige.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ac10833-8236-436b-bc3c-92793ceecfc0">
      <Text>RAU RAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="84a264aa-2cde-4bd1-be10-60d94a801eac">
      <Text>(Her smile is tight enough to crack a seed)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="54ed6ae6-9dd2-4dec-a673-d30c3cf30cb1">
      <Text>It’s "Authentic Adaptation," Miss Verbena. We pride ourselves on the finest Vietnamese folk-mistings in Woodwork.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9b62a5d1-a389-4116-9d52-cb10946fa3ab">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="87584287-ca90-4b83-be59-1299b3c9588b">
      <Text>(Dropping from the vines, landing next to Verbena)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00c519ae-354c-44ec-9695-c5a8cf9137bc">
      <Text>What she means is, this place has soul. And according to the... uh... local legends...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4126dbc1-8854-458b-bdd7-b7b6ec6e15c9">
      <Text>Pyrus pulls the PETRIFIED BARK JOURNAL from their hoodie, hiding the cover from Verbena but showing Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b8ac499-81d1-4ac3-8811-190946708c1b">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="9bdeb128-6772-480f-9319-73f8f083e9af">
      <Text>(Whispering to Parsley)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1d2a8cf-5e30-4a75-814f-0250c31ed587">
      <Text>The Journal says this salon is built on a "Spiritual Sap-Line." If we crank the misting-system to "Max Photosynthesis," the star will glow so bright she’ll be visible from Woody Holly!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5a406347-d8fa-4b5d-8c55-999dba541f89">
      <Text>PARSLEY (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eac5596a-36de-4244-b27b-11c085403fc5">
      <Text>I knew Pyrus was about to do something "bad-natured." But I’m eleven. And in Dirty City, the only thing more dangerous than a bad idea is a boring one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d9bfe43-f956-4b51-968a-0ef65a9bf0cf">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b3d14ec9-4fe0-472b-9f51-20e5710d8972">
      <Text>(To Verbena)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e21c352-9b2d-4fea-a1a7-2b4aa076372e">
      <Text>Wait until you see the lighting, Miss Verbena! It’s... condition-breaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6a48125-7d2f-4ce7-a655-bf9fbfd8f2d8">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="6753cbf7-5888-4728-9123-d43478465027">
      <Text>(Raising an eyebrow)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="640f030b-5cf5-4253-83a6-a3a6a5157907">
      <Text>Condition-breaking? Bold words for a garnish. Show me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2de90481-78c8-4dd2-ac8f-533ac27c822b">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="845ce4c9-9e50-4c3a-ae45-b9bb5dbcdc78">
      <Text>(Grabbing a lever on the wall labeled "DO NOT TOUCH")</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b25e9df-db66-45cc-8d55-c09f3fd5e069">
      <Text>One order of "Greenlight" coming right up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5ea1c34-6f34-4b48-be22-820a818fe210">
      <Text>THE MUSIC KICKS IN: A high-tempo pop-rock beat with a Vietnamese zither undertone. Pyrus slams the lever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e9f1eabf-2886-4d9f-b01e-f01c936bf674">
      <Text>PARSLEY (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a0ed99e-2239-444b-bcb2-a00ff711ec2c">
      <Text>And that’s when the "Cleanest City in Woodwork" got real messy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97490527-5148-4d12-958b-776c538fd0c0">
      <Text>WHOOSH! A blast of ultraviolet light and herbal mist explodes from the vents. Verbena’s hair turns neon green. Parsley and Pyrus look at each other, horrified and thrilled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54e9f1a3-17d3-47cc-97f4-d07418260a15">
      <Text>PYRUS &amp; PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a69b3fb6-ff28-4425-b181-75fa90c7b046">
      <Text>(In a soft, rhythmic harmony)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9746e541-cee3-463d-89ee-ed0e3f9a19fe">
      <Text>Photosynthesis... photosynthesis...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="07256364-5fba-4033-9b84-3e7e4e48064b">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bbadec88-3bed-4952-a856-b89c4d1c7e8d">
      <Text>Photo!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34082415-f846-429a-9488-855007a29a6b">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>. The camera captures a freeze-frame of Verbena looking shocked, Rau looking ready to faint, and the two boys giving a double-thumbs up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="1c331481-de8c-439f-b619-f8420d8912e0">
      <Text>FADE TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08d4d24c-03e2-4652-b6f9-9df2cd6dc5a7">
      <Text>PARSLEY (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b124eab0-14ef-4d72-9021-446c87503253">
      <Text>(In a dry, SpongeBob-meets-Dipper tone)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79b96e56-686a-41da-a6ed-da0c58f79319">
      <Text>In Dirty City, the "Greenlight" usually means a SAPP Agent caught you without a permit. But today, it meant my mom’s dreams were finally budding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13f50ff6-785d-4e2b-ae75-93b3811589e0">
      <Text>VERBENA is standing in the center of the salon, her neon-green hair smoking slightly. She stares at herself in a mirror made of polished bark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a286db2d-1f5d-4ff4-9d35-68fa10c47d9f">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="ad09b8af-b462-4b88-a383-7169e16dbc51">
      <Text>(In awe)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37bbfb2f-8807-416c-b8e0-2a89b1178e4b">
      <Text>This... this glow. It’s not just styling. It’s cellular. It’s visceral. It’s... marketable.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec806686-d889-4e39-8833-7f8283b62fb4">
      <Text>RAU RAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="24c9193f-0d2d-4cea-875a-a351791385a5">
      <Text>(A blur of sixteen hands, frantically trying to fan away the UV-smoke)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="815e0340-7c2a-4bb8-94dc-b22eece7f914">
      <Text>I am so sorry, Miss Verbena! The wiring in this district is—well, it’s mostly literal vines—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb3a7363-512b-4a19-961b-9654b48e2c2d">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="0c5173aa-5541-4086-aedd-b2635d58c057">
      <Text>(Interrupting)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8303a9a-4819-4dbc-8900-b7a0a11cb950">
      <Text>It’s genius! Lami Mentha is tired of "Sanitized Studios." She wants "Gritty Garden." She wants Dirty City. I’m bringing her here. Tomorrow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe270db7-08d5-4105-a726-2bdc438186a4">
      <Text>RAU RAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="07f63d40-eff1-4556-a3d6-7443eb643e0e">
      <Text>(Freezing mid-misting)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62fd1835-e7e2-42a1-ad98-5d8bfd332888">
      <Text>Tomorrow? But I haven't even bleached the mulch!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa3aa1cb-9ea6-4306-a95f-1e79dfb0f701">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="686c79d8-ed3c-4113-986c-4ea3aa96220d">
      <Text>(Already tapping on a digital leaf-tablet)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e52c2f54-b24d-4090-9087-aacaf9fca0cf">
      <Text>Don't change a thing. The "invasive" lighting stays. If Lami doesn't glow like a radioactive glow-stick by the end of the shoot, the contract is off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9e29d8cb-8e26-437a-8a1e-3b5b71807735">
      <Text>Verbena struts out the door, her heels clicking like a beetle’s mandibles. Rau looks like she’s about to experience premature wilting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d5128337-8d8e-476d-89da-fdd62194c184">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e84099ad-c0d9-4711-bb26-0022ed4259f4">
      <Text>(Sliding down from the ceiling vents)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="724f4577-f0a4-47f1-ac4b-abd4019db6c9">
      <Text>"Invasive lighting"? "Radioactive glow-stick"? P-Ram, we’re geniuses!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a132bc86-ec58-4cd8-a704-f76e8cb4e5aa">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="cd805386-f8d3-441b-8e0a-6e21551d2913">
      <Text>(Staring at the BARK JOURNAL)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86610295-bd86-42d3-a667-1eff327d2e60">
      <Text>Pyrus, we aren't geniuses. We’re liars. The Journal says the "Supernova" setting we used burns out the chloroplasts after three hours. If Lami Mentha wilts on national TV, she won't just shut us down... she’ll have us turned into potpourri.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84cde252-8dd0-424c-bd8b-1f5ef18110af">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="7ce6e62d-f1fd-4acf-a8cf-429b954740de">
      <Text>(Nervous grin)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="89eb6a35-3969-4a39-bde9-9bb8f2cd2671">
      <Text>Well, looks like we have twenty-four hours to find a "Permanent Photosynthesis" spell. Or, you know, find a really good wig.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="258ee443-394e-475b-8624-086a35f0be85">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>SCENE 7</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9ef2a64a-4fb1-4b57-823f-8a9bdc081615">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. FIGLEAF NIGHTCLUB - LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="51f81ce3-0172-4277-a38a-76f6593043c3">
      <Text>The club is dark, illuminated only by a disco ball made of a giant, glowing mushroom. MALUS CRABAPPLE (40s) is sitting at the bar, nursing a glass of "Sparkling Sap."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f62d49bc-b08c-4832-ae94-9a6db0f35065">
      <Text>MALUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="06f71667-ea2c-44da-911e-fdb156fcb0a0">
      <Text>(Watching Parsley and Pyrus enter)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b5fb15d9-00cb-4ef8-9f38-51ece74dad71">
      <Text>You two look like you’ve been through a wood-chipper. What did you do to Rau’s salon?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="360a89d1-3cf3-4120-b892-530301162ac0">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89daac46-0643-44f8-8ce3-f96f573ed3ce">
      <Text>We landed the Lami Mentha contract, Unty!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf7f5451-5d07-4d7b-a70e-725cca3472bc">
      <Text>MALUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="1a8f4f1c-5ad3-450a-a174-104b8234b5ec">
      <Text>(Eyes widening)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="78d40769-d157-43cc-9a0e-e6ef37d18b4a">
      <Text>Mentha? The "Mint Condition" star? That plant is a diva. She’s got enough ego to shade an entire forest. If she’s coming to Dirty City, there’s a reason. And it isn't the mulch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e0d579e-8bef-4a10-8e4f-9b8b0c502047">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34c4632e-0a11-4230-af02-9a0428af2b08">
      <Text>What do you mean?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b49b4dd-28d2-435c-b655-50af4d393f6b">
      <Text>MALUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="af34d878-0936-4380-9bdc-fca8cddd67c3">
      <Text>(Checking the shadows for SAPP Agents)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7a17106-f4bd-4a7e-9b97-4e3af903267d">
      <Text>I heard whispers back in the Paddy War. Mentha isn't just a singer. She’s a scout for Secretary Rhizo Blomquist. She finds the "brightest" transplants... and then the SAPP Agency finds a reason to uproot them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="228518d3-d746-4aa1-ad50-0d8f237ba55b">
      <Text>PARSLEY (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b44f207a-1c77-4509-a54e-d018a1200ac0">
      <Text>(Chilled)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e146a6b-19b3-437d-b674-49d1f5a97e33">
      <Text>Suddenly, the "Greenlight" felt more like a "Stoplight."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="768a8032-d123-4429-b27b-6ee9463118da">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9d882db1-bdd2-42dc-af4a-72623d4d623c">
      <Text>(Opening the Journal to a page titled: THE SILENT HARVEST)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48c8381e-debc-4e4b-beec-df8da6355cd7">
      <Text>Pyrus... look. The Six-Fingered Leaf symbol. It’s on the back of Lami’s latest Green-Ray DVD.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a80ddb9-9783-4fec-8ee0-160afb651592">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a8d3f523-07e9-451b-bd2a-b08e371e9395">
      <Text>(Serious for once)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c4ed1c91-4d88-4ddb-94d3-4d9b43a76466">
      <Text>If the reality show is a trap for my neighbor... then we’re gonna need a bigger distraction than a yellow-tinted bee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="254756be-c204-4198-a8f6-5da755274e05">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="8" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS &amp; PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SALONTRO - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac1e4566-19ce-4c34-b878-fe32c4bc0f0e">
      <Text>BOMBUS is still resting on the stoplight, glowing faintly yellow. The camera zooms out to show a blacked-out SAPP VAN parked across the street. A hidden camera lens (shaped like a knot in a tree) focuses on the salon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1537f9a8-8338-4951-8b49-cb1eebb2eb56">
      <Text>PYRUS &amp; PARSLEY (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b9305bd2-5658-4ae4-801a-39166144a9e0">
      <Text>(A dark, minor-key harmony)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7aab6562-7e92-49fc-a7ad-491de505ddc9">
      <Text>Photosynthesis... photosynthesis...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e940c8df-fe47-49e9-b2d9-6e3fd4f079b5">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2da93f9e-af82-4558-8063-9d08eb90209b">
      <Text>(Snapping a photo of the SAPP van from the shadows)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2acef06c-ba86-4173-813e-8c35e6fb203f">
      <Text>Photo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="482da3f6-0f1f-4d74-aedb-604b9a919c95">
      <Text>FLASH. The image captures the SAPP logo: a hand holding a shovel over a pile of cilantro.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="c8087dc9-22ab-4e1d-b159-9ff2ee37550c">
      <Text>FADE TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

